Patch to GDE GoZen (github.com/VoylinsGamedevJourney/gde_gozen) at f9448619, applied by scripts/build_gozen.sh
(git apply ignores this text): asks FFmpeg for <codec>_nvmpi (the Jetson's hardware decoder) first and falls back
to software; with the hardware decoder, frames come as NV12 and, after GoZenVideo.set_target_size(), scaled
down by the hardware to the size they are shown at (fewer pixels to copy and upload); SConstruct lean=yes.
Hardware decoding tested on Jetson AGX Orin, L4T R36.4.3 / JetPack 6.2, and Jetson Xavier NX, L4T R35.6.4 /
JetPack 5.1.4. Software decoding: any Linux x86_64 / arm64.

